      "reason": "The prior edge asserted a causal link from 'Maintenance acceptance signature was not yet signed' to the focal event. Evidence (finding-fakvn3, finding-dua1bs) confirms work occurred before formal release, but this condition alone does not explain why pressure dropped at P-R while upstream remained stable. The absence of an ECP revision or temporary instruction is a procedural gap that created vulnerability, not the physical cause of the interruption.",
