    "summary": "The investigation board has been pruned to remove circular reasoning and procedural gaps misidentified as physical causes. The focal event (instrument-air low-pressure indication at P-R) remains unexplained by the current evidence, which confirms upstream stability but does not identify the specific valve state or service-routing change that caused localized pressure loss.",
