    ],
    "alternatives": [
      "A downstream leak or blockage in RHOB's local branch caused localized pressure loss while upstream remained stable.",
      "An undocumented service-routing change diverted flow away from P-R without triggering a broader alarm."
    ],"confidence":0.65},"evidenceRequests":[
